OL,3,GNEWSAWoman rescued twice backs second
OL,4,Aair ambulance
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who has been helped twice by
OL,7,Fthe Lincs & Notts Air Ambulance has
OL,8,Fgiven her backing to the campaign for a
OL,9,Fsecond helicopter.
OL,11,FRuth Ransome suffered two equestrian
OL,12,Faccidents in three years and has since
OL,13,Fraised #12,000 for the charity.
OL,15,FAn appeal it launched in May to raise
OL,16,F#500,000 for a second helicopter has
OL,17,Freached the halfway mark.
OL,19,FRansome described the service as "an
OL,20,Fabsolute lifesaver".
